{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pulls/15439","id":4236833420,"node_id":"PR_kwDOIygeJs78iPKM","html_url":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/15439","diff_url":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/15439.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/15439.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/issues/15439","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pulls/15439/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pulls/15439/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/issues/15439/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/statuses/31d8281804c6c78ff1a6e484e9c4dc28387d938c","number":15439,"state":"closed","locked":true,"title":"Add MiniMaxH3AddGuide for anchoring image and audio guides at any frame","user":{"login":"drozbay","id":17261091,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjYxMDkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17261091?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/drozbay","html_url":"https://github.com/drozbay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drozbay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drozbay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drozbay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drozbay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drozbay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drozbay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drozbay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drozbay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drozbay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Currently MiniMax H3 implementation in Comfyui only allows keyframe guides at the first and last frame. The model itself is capable of addressing guides by position on a continuous time axis, so this removes that restriction and exposes it as a node.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"478\" height=\"297\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9d8fdfab-1284-4836-9ed7-43aeff041bf5\" />\r\n\r\n**MiniMaxH3AddGuide** anchors a guide at any frame_idx (negative counts from the end):\r\n- a still image\r\n- a clip (batches snap down to the model's valid clip lengths: 5, 22, 39... frames)\r\n- audio, anchored at the same position on the timeline\r\n- any combination, and nodes chain for multiple guides\r\n\r\nExample: feed the first 22 frames of an existing video plus its audio into one AddGuide at frame_idx 0 and the model generates the continuation of both streams. Or put a still at frame 60 of 124 to force a it to hit that frame.\r\n\r\nFirst/last anchors produce the same coordinates as before, so existing workflows are unchanged.\r\n\r\nExample workflow for simple adding keyframes:\r\n[video_minimax_h3_r2v_addguides_v1.json](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30954773/video_minimax_h3_r2v_addguides_v1.json)\r\n\r\n[15439_assets_v1.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30954679/15439_assets_v1.zip)\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4dce6b58-eb58-4b9d-843c-12d37965ad9e\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-09T02:05:18Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T19:55:46Z","closed_at":"2026-08-13T19:55:37Z","merged_at":"2026-08-13T19:55:37Z","merge_commit_sha":"e01fb4c56b7a88149d469b99cbbfe3223d715054","assignee":{"login":"kijai","id":40791699,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzkxNjk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40791699?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kijai","html_url":"https://github.com/kijai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kijai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kijai/following{/other_u